    "head_branch": "chore/alternating-bench",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): bench can time any branch or commit as the head\n\nA `head` input checks the ref out into its own worktree beside the run's\nbranch, so a branch whose own bench.yml predates `rounds` can still be\ncompared over alternating rounds, and bench_compare.py still runs from the\nbranch the workflow is on. Empty, it times the run's branch as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKUhViTbS7kfMBSZozDAco",
